SALEM[,] ORE. -- Six Willamette University football players[ have] been named First Team All-Northwest Conference for the 2007 season, as selected by the NWC head coaches. An additional four Bearcats received Second Team All-[N]WC honors and seven WU players were chosen for Honorable Mention.
SALEM[, O]RE. -- Pacific Lutheran University built a 14-0 lead in the first quarter, then[ held off] Willamette University for a 17-10 win on Saturday,[ Nov.] 10, in a Northwest Conference game at McCulloch Stadium. PLU improved to 7-2 overall, 4-2 in the NWC. Willamette ended its season at 4-6 overall, 3-3 in the NWC.
